# Synthetic repository instructions

BMAD Method 6.11.0 uses `_bmad-output/project-context.md`,
`_bmad-output/index.yaml`, `_bmad-output/authorities.yaml`, and
`scripts/verify-bmad.sh`. Repository authority takes precedence. Protected
studies are never modified or used as scratch space.

<!-- BMAD-GOVERNANCE-POLICY:START -->
{
  "artifact_governance": {
    "authorities": "_bmad-output/authorities.yaml",
    "index": "_bmad-output/index.yaml"
  },
  "authoritative_sources": {
    "conflict_action": "stop-and-request-repository-maintainer-review"
  },
  "bmad": {
    "installer": {
      "version": "6.11.0"
    }
  },
  "project_context": "_bmad-output/project-context.md",
  "studies": {
    "future_marker_keywords": [
      "frozen",
      "locked",
      "pre-registered"
    ]
  },
  "verifier": "scripts/verify-bmad.sh"
}
<!-- BMAD-GOVERNANCE-POLICY:END -->
